WWLAN-3535 / W43756-572 / W43711-2575: 6G PNO issues
============================================================

ISSUE

6 GHz PNO was failing across multiple platforms, but the failure was different depending on the platform.

WORKAROUND

1. Reproduced the PNO issue on 4384.
2. Checked the expected PFN event in dmesg.
3. Repeated the same scenario on 43756E PCIe.
4. Repeated it again on 43711 SDIO.
5. Compared the behavior across the three platforms.
6. Identified that 4384 and 43756E had a common FW issue, while 43711 had an SDIO timing issue.
7. Filed the platform-specific evidence separately.

RESOLUTION

FW team fixed the common 6G PNO issue for 4384 and 43756E. The SDIO timing issue was fixed separately for 43711. All three platforms passed 6G PNO after the fixes.


