WTEST-13189: Full console log collection
============================================================

ISSUE

Automation was giving only summary pass/fail results. When a testcase failed, detailed logs were not available, so debugging required manual reruns.

WORKAROUND

1. Identified that summary logs were not enough for failure analysis.
2. Filed an automation enhancement request.
3. Requested `wl dump console` after every sub-testcase.
4. Requested separate log files linked to the testcase ID.
5. Used the updated logging during later regression runs.

RESOLUTION

Automation team implemented full console log collection. Later regression runs had complete logs and failure-debugging time reduced from hours to minutes.


